{"id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-game.md","title":"Game","display":"df-game — Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-game","aliases":["58-df-game"],"display":"df-game — Game","depends_on":["[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-game — Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\">\\(X\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\)</span>（合法着集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{s\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\">\\(X^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{s\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq X^\\omega\\)</span>（获胜对局集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{turn}:X^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{turn}:X^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{turn}(s)=|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\bmod2\">\\(\\operatorname{turn}(s)=|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\bmod2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}game} \\vdash G_A\\coloneqq(\\{s\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\},\\operatorname{turn},A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}game} \\vdash G_A\\coloneqq(\\{s\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\},\\operatorname{turn},A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Players alternately choose elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The resulting play <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X^\\omega\">\\(x\\in X^\\omega\\)</span> is winning for player I exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{s\